{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Act 3: The Tennis Court, the Prison and the Diary",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s04b01",
     "shot": "eg_open",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Estates-General opened at Versailles on 5 May 1789.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:May",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b02",
     "shot": "eg_hall",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Three estates, one hall.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b03",
     "shot": "eg_hall",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And here's how voting worked.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:600,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b04",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "So there are three estates, and each gets one vote.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b05",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Correct. Ancient and fair.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b06",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "But we're ninety-eight percent of France.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b07",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "And you get one vote.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b08",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "And the clergy?",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b09",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "One vote.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b10",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "And you?",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b11",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "One vote.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b12",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "So two percent of the country controls two thirds of the votes.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b13",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "It's tradition.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b14",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "It's maths.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b15",
     "shot": "sketch_vote",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Tradition is just maths that's been around longer.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b16",
     "shot": "national_assembly",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The Third Estate refused to play along.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "hit",
       "w:refused",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b17",
     "shot": "national_assembly",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On 17 June it declared itself the National Assembly, the voice of the nation.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:National",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b18",
     "shot": "hall_locked",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Three days later it found its meeting hall locked and guarded,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:locked",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b19",
     "shot": "tennis_oath",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "so the deputies marched to an indoor tennis court nearby and swore an oath",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b20",
     "shot": "tennis_oath",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "not to leave until France had a constitution,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b21",
     "shot": "tennis_oath",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "which is just the written rulebook for how a country is run.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b22",
     "shot": "tennis_oath",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "That's the Tennis Court Oath, 20 June 1789,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "impact",
       "w:Tennis",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b23",
     "shot": "tennis_oath",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "the moment the people stopped asking and started claiming.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b24",
     "shot": "necker",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The king's answer was to move troops toward Paris and sack the popular finance",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:troops",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b25",
     "shot": "necker",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "minister, Jacques Necker, on 11 July.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:Necker,",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b26",
     "shot": "necker",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Paris heard 'the soldiers are coming' and exploded.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:exploded.",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b27",
     "shot": "bastille_day",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On 14 July a crowd hunting for gunpowder and weapons went to the Bastille,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b28",
     "shot": "bastille_day",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "a royal fortress-prison in the east of the city.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b29",
     "shot": "seven",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And here's the part that broke me when I was researching this.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b30",
     "shot": "seven",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The Bastille held exactly seven prisoners.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:seven",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b31",
     "shot": "seven",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Four forgers, two men judged insane, and one nobleman locked up by his own family.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:forgers,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:insane,",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:nobleman",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b32",
     "shot": "seven",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "That was the great symbol of tyranny.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b33",
     "shot": "seven",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Seven men, and a lot of gunpowder.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:gunpowder.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b34",
     "shot": "bastille_toll",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Around a hundred attackers died in the fighting.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b35",
     "shot": "bastille_toll",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The governor, Bernard de Launay, was killed and his head was paraded on a pike.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b36",
     "shot": "bastille_toll",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "That was day one of liberty.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b37",
     "shot": "king_wrote",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And the king?",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b38",
     "shot": "king_wrote",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "We know what he wrote.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b39",
     "shot": "sketch_nothing",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "Sire, the Bastille has fallen.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b40",
     "shot": "sketch_nothing",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Is it a revolt?",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b41",
     "shot": "sketch_nothing",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "No, Sire. It is a revolution.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b42",
     "shot": "sketch_nothing",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "...Did I shoot anything today?",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b43",
     "shot": "sketch_nothing",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "No, Sire.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b44",
     "shot": "sketch_nothing",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Then I shall write 'Nothing.'",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b45",
     "shot": "sketch_nothing",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "Sire, the capital is in the hands of the crowd.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b46",
     "shot": "sketch_nothing",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Nothing, and a note about the weather.",
     "mood": "playful",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b47",
     "shot": "subscribe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Quick pause.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b48",
     "shot": "subscribe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "If you want the rest of this, the Terror,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b49",
     "shot": "subscribe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the emperor, and why France is on its fifth republic,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b50",
     "shot": "subscribe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a subscribe genuinely helps, and it costs less than a baguette.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:subscribe",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b51",
     "shot": "aug4",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In August the revolution wrote its mission statement.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "grand"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b52",
     "shot": "aug4",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On the night of 4 August the nobles gave up their feudal privileges,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:privileges,",
       0.7
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "grand"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b53",
     "shot": "declaration",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and on 26 August the Assembly adopted the Declaration of the Rights of Man",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       4,
       0.6
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "grand"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b54",
     "shot": "declaration",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and of the Citizen, which says people are born free and equal in rights.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       4,
       0.6
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "grand"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b55",
     "shot": "declaration",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It was one of the most influential documents of the modern world.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       4,
       0.6
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "grand"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b56",
     "shot": "no_bread",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But rights don't fill stomachs, and bread was still scarce.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b57",
     "shot": "womens_march",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "So on 5 October 1789, thousands of Paris women,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "steps",
       6,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b58",
     "shot": "womens_march",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "many of them market sellers, marched about twelve miles in the rain to Versailles demanding bread.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "steps",
       6,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b59",
     "shot": "womens_march",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "By the next day they had brought the royal family back to Paris,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b60",
     "shot": "womens_march",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "effectively as guests of the people.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b61",
     "shot": "october_cal",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Keep that image in your back pocket.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b62",
     "shot": "october_cal",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "When prices spike and the government seems deaf,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b63",
     "shot": "october_cal",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the crowd goes to where the power sleeps.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b64",
     "shot": "october_cal",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And notice the month.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b65",
     "shot": "october_cal",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "October.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "impact",
       "w:October.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b66",
     "shot": "disguise_tease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "For two years the king and the revolution tried to share one country.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b67",
     "shot": "disguise_tease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It ended with a midnight escape attempt, in disguise,",
     "date": 1791,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "steps",
       "w:escape",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s04b68",
     "shot": "disguise_tease",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "with the king pretending to be somebody's servant.",
     "date": 1791,
     "sfx": []
    }
   ],
   "mood": "tension"
  }
 ]
}